{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51822","headline":"金华山 · 袁吉","name":"金华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金华山色与天齐，一径盘纡尽石梯。\n步步前登清汉近，时时回首白云低。\n风偷药气名何限，水泛花光路即迷。\n洞口数声仙犬吠，始知羽客此真栖。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》一二七《金华山部》）（〖1〗光绪《金华县志》卷二称袁吉爲「唐刺史」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}